{"id":"4db897d11ef2e9e3","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-model-set.md","title":"Model Set / Hintikka set","display":"df-model-set — Model Set / Hintikka set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-model-set","aliases":["57-df-model-set"],"display":"df-model-set — Model Set / Hintikka set","depends_on":["[[57-df-atomic-formula]]","[[57-df-subformula]]","[[57-df-substitution-formula]]","[[57-df-sentence]]","[[57-df-term]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-model-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-model-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-model-set — Model Set / Hintikka set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c503c7cd3e5d57d1\" href=\"?note=c503c7cd3e5d57d1\" title=\"57-df-subformula\">57-df-subformula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"237ed61a00bb9297\" href=\"?note=237ed61a00bb9297\" title=\"57-df-substitution-formula\">57-df-substitution-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\Theta\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"053d3ef4d2401abe\" href=\"?note=053d3ef4d2401abe\" title=\"57-df-term\">57-df-term</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[t/x]\">\\(\\varphi[t/x]\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"237ed61a00bb9297\" href=\"?note=237ed61a00bb9297\" title=\"57-df-substitution-formula\">57-df-substitution-formula</a> 的原始代入，不自动附加自由可代入条件。</li>\n<li>本条目保留原五个条件，包括 H4、H5 均以前件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\varphi\">\\(\\forall x\\varphi\\)</span> 开始；不把 H5 擅自换成存在量词见证公理。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ModelSet}(\\Theta)\\longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\ \\neg(\\alpha\\in\\Theta\\land\\neg\\alpha\\in\\Theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\\n[((\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in\\Theta\\to\\varphi\\in\\Theta\\land\\psi\\in\\Theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}\\land((\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\in\\Theta\\to\\varphi\\in\\Theta\\lor\\psi\\in\\Theta)]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\\n[((\\forall x\\varphi)\\in\\Theta\\to\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\ (\\varphi[t/x]\\in\\Theta))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}\\land((\\forall x\\varphi)\\in\\Theta\\to\\exists t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\ (\\varphi[t/x]\\in\\Theta))].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ModelSet}(\\Theta)\\longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\ \\neg(\\alpha\\in\\Theta\\land\\neg\\alpha\\in\\Theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\\n[((\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\in\\Theta\\to\\varphi\\in\\Theta\\land\\psi\\in\\Theta)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}\\land((\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\in\\Theta\\to\\varphi\\in\\Theta\\lor\\psi\\in\\Theta)]\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\\n[((\\forall x\\varphi)\\in\\Theta\\to\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\ (\\varphi[t/x]\\in\\Theta))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{13em}\\land((\\forall x\\varphi)\\in\\Theta\\to\\exists t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\ (\\varphi[t/x]\\in\\Theta))].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>所有条件现在是合取且元变量均绑定。该谓词的原条件不是完整的一阶 Hintikka 模型存在条件；文件名称不额外提供省略的闭包或等号公理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e38e198d11ebfafa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-subformula","status":"resolved","id":"c503c7cd3e5d57d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-subformula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-substitution-formula","status":"resolved","id":"237ed61a00bb9297","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-substitution-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"38cb16fd577caf7b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"053d3ef4d2401abe","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-atomic-formula","status":"